<img src="https://api.mehewara.edu.lk/api/v1/media/legacy/supabase-storage/2b5d4d82-bb15-5608-bcbe-433e8d0d4402.unknown" alt="Screenshot 2026-07-02 230648.png" class="mhw-q-img" />
